---
import Memo from '@components/Memo.astro';
import Base from '@layouts/Base.astro';
---

<Base
  title="Atmofrost"
  page="home"
  description="Atmofrost Inc. is the corporate body of dreams and passion"
>
  <h1 class="af-title af-rise" data-d="1">
    <em>Atmofrost</em> is the corporate body of dreams and passion
  </h1>

  <p class="af-prose af-rise" data-d="2" style="max-width: 56ch;">
    Every intangible, abstract object requires a body to live through. Atmofrost
    hopes to realize this idea without compromising the creativity that it
    fosters. Corporate matters and legal text, leadership and bureaucracy,
    marketing and networking.
  </p>

  <p
    class="af-prose"
    style="color: var(--af-mute); font-style: italic; max-width: 50ch;"
  >
    <span class="af-date"> Since March 2026</span>
  </p>
</Base>
